{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And now</b> — It was the duty of the priests of righteousness to pray on Israel's behalf, as written in the book of Joel: \"Let the priests weep,\" and there it is written: \"and YHWH will call to the land.\" The meaning of \"entreat, please, the face of YHWH\" is concerning the curse, for we are cursed, as written: \"and He will grant us grace,\" for because of you this evil has come, and this is \"from your hand has this been to you.\""], :book :malachi, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Malachi -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/malachi"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:08.219745436Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}